      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "html": "<p>At Natalie Marie Jewellery, we offer both, ensuring all stones are certified by either the International Gemmological Institute (IGI) or the Gemmological Institute of America (GIA).</p>\n<p>The journey of a laboratory grown diamond is complex and multi-staged:</p>\n<ul class=\"number-count\">\n<li>\n<span>1</span> Grown in a laboratory</li>\n<li>\n<span>2</span> Cut and polished (often in a separate facility)</li>\n<li>\n<span>3</span> Certified by an independent gemological institute</li>\n<li>\n<span>4</span> Sold through the global market</li>\n<li>\n<span>5</span> Selected by a jeweller </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Like natural diamonds, this journey can involve multiple stages and locations, which can impact traceability.</p>"
      }
    },
