        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p><strong>Sustainability Considerations</strong></p>",
        "description": "<p>Laboratory grown diamonds are often perceived as a more sustainable option, however the reality is nuanced.</p><p>Key considerations include:</p>",
        "html": "<p>For a laboratory grown diamond to be considered more sustainable, it would require:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Renewable energy sources</li>\n<li>Transparent supply chains</li>\n<li>Verified carbon reduction or offsetting</li>\n</ul>\n<p>At present, industry wide transparency remains limited, making these claims difficult to fully validate.</p>\n<style>\n.features--heading-normal .u-h3{font-size:20px;}\n</style>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_text": "",
        "button_1_link": "",
        "button_2_text": "",
        "button_2_link": "",
        "button_style": "underline"
      }
