      "name": "Three column",
      "settings": {
        "enable_dark": true,
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p><strong>Our Approach</strong></p>",
        "description": "<ul><li>100% of our laboratory grown diamond suppliers are compliant with our due diligence requirements</li><li>Each stone is carefully selected to meet our quality standards </li></ul>",
        "feature_text": "<p>We approach laboratory grown diamonds with the same intention that guides everything we create:<br/><br/><strong>to offer transparency, honour craftsmanship, and support you in choosing a stone that feels deeply personal.</strong><br/><br/>At Natalie Marie Jewellery, we encourage clients to view both laboratory grown and natural diamonds through a different lens: not as financial assets, but as meaningful investments in a personal story, a commitment, a milestone or a future shared together.<br/><br/>The true value of a diamond often lies not in its future resale potential, but in what it represents to the individual wearing it. Whether laboratory grown or natural, the most important investment is choosing a stone that feels aligned with your values, priorities and the significance of the moment it celebrates.</p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
